Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.91,0:00:04.97,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄契闊！福蝶噗雞！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:07.90,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主好帥啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.47,0:00:09.42,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.65,0:00:12.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,接著一起來飛翼衝擊吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.01,0:00:14.10,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,愛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.27,0:00:15.40,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,預備
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:20.18,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄氣闊！飛翼衝擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:21.78,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:27.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎... 國王和王妃還沒有醒...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:32.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 說好聽點是維持現狀...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.75,0:00:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人民和軍隊都沒有放棄希望
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是 不安的情緒一直在蔓延...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.07,0:00:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是閃亮藥水沒錯吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.45,0:00:49.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還需要多少 才能夠製作解除沉睡詛咒的藥？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.64,0:00:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure們正在竭盡全力收集閃亮能量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.65,0:00:56.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在的量還遠不足夠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.36,0:00:59.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:00.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！我們正在開會
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:04.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,莉虹莓隊員！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.24,0:01:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！有件事情我要告訴你...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.47,0:01:10.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你別急！我會跟她講的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:14.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是關於隊長... 關於現在下落不明的颯拉拉隊長的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們得到了新的情報！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}虛蜢達 最後的秘策！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:06.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個人...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.24,0:03:18.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你說的是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.50,0:03:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.61,0:03:24.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近有很多人向我們報告 都說"見到了隊長"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:28.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 是只有目擊情報嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.59,0:03:31.74,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,又不是妖怪或者幽靈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:34.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,目擊到之後都是怎麼樣的情況？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.75,0:03:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關於這個... 目擊者都說 隊長就像煙一樣消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.53,0:03:44.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的 還是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:47.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,光是在這裡談 也查不出頭緒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.30,0:03:53.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,請繼續搜索 如果有什麼新的消息 一定要告訴我們
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:57.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是多小的線索... 我們等你 莉虹莓隊員
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:03:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.44,0:04:02.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:05.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:08.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚哇... 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.78,0:04:12.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:15.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:16.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.33,0:04:20.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是颯拉拉隊長留給我的信
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.34,0:04:23.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,“別停下腳步 英雄少女"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:27.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我想謄寫到手帳上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:30.60,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎... 抱歉打擾到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.82,0:04:32.24,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.14,0:04:35.15,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,愛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.55,0:04:36.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼說呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:40.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不管大事小事都會記到手帳上的小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:44.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,居然一直沒把隊長的囑咐記下來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:45.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,有點出乎意料啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.70,0:04:47.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不是大事小事都會記的...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:50.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？可是上一次...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:53.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,每週二是肉打半價的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:53.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}牛肉祭 限期2週
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:57.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那是... 你就當沒有過！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.63,0:05:02.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,寫在這本手帳上 就代表著我絕對會履行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.57,0:05:04.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我是秉持這個信念才會記手帳的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.66,0:05:07.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,"別停下腳步 英雄少女"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.44,0:05:11.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前都沒有能夠履行的自信...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.00,0:05:17.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,颯拉拉隊長要是有個三長兩短 我還能繼續前進嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:20.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我還能繼續做一個英雄嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.19,0:05:22.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:25.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才謝謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.41,0:05:26.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:29.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在前進的腳步放緩速度的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.07,0:05:33.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是真白同學在我身邊 推動了我前進...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.03,0:05:38.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我有了記下來的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.01,0:05:42.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,把颯拉拉隊長的話語 記在這本寶貴的手帳上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:48.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,"別停下腳步 英雄少女"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.01,0:05:50.13,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.54,0:05:52.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:55.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對要成為英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.09,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,愛！英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:05:58.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要當英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.61,0:06:00.03,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.62,0:06:02.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定... 能成英雄的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.84,0:06:08.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,餃子... 這是誕生在這個世界的究極美食！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.55,0:06:09.66,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,味道是很棒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.83,0:06:14.08,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,但是最妙的 還得是大家圍著大盤子邊吃邊鬧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:16.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,止不住的幸福呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.82,0:06:19.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也會做小空喜歡的起司餃子哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.74,0:06:22.30,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,起司 稀飯稀飯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:26.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,（心跳聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.09,0:06:42.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.28,0:06:44.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,颯拉拉隊長！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:46.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.73,0:07:44.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,颯拉拉隊長！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.24,0:07:48.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.97,0:08:07.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,小戲法啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.35,0:08:12.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是用一點點暗塌谷能量 就能做出來的幻影
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.74,0:08:16.53,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,要是真的話 你現在已經成兩瓣了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:21.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼？你為什麼要耍這種把戲戲弄人！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.43,0:08:22.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼意思嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.23,0:08:26.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,有意思啊 不要太有意思哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.10,0:08:28.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我有什麼仇...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:31.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,有啊！仇大著呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.31,0:08:33.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不許動！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:39.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你膽敢再靠近小空一絲
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:41.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕對饒不了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.88,0:09:03.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虛...虛蜢蜢...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.11,0:09:13.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我恨你... 憎恨到胸口都快要裂開了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.23,0:09:16.55,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我這樣強大而不失溫柔的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:20.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,催生出了這種陰暗的憎恨 這個責任...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.89,0:09:22.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你可得好好負責啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:24.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你太自私了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.62,0:09:25.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.74,0:09:34.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看我英雄亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.64,0:09:49.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看我英雄亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:56.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空幻鏡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:56.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:09:59.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天籟接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:09:59.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.59,0:10:06.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.94,0:10:08.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.94,0:10:08.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.25,0:10:18.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.25,0:10:18.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:26.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飛奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:26.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.80,0:10:34.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,暢快躍起！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.80,0:10:34.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:57.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,廣闊無限的藍天！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.79,0:11:00.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.79,0:11:00.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}天空愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:07.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:15.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:19.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼鬼祟祟地躲在亂暴獸的背後！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:23.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就能夠滿足你那無謂的自尊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:26.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈... 亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:30.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:39.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:43.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,俐落的劍法...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:46.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,被砍到的話 可不是吃一下痛那麼簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:48.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:53.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,可是！只要砍不到 也算不了什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.30,0:11:55.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.15,0:11:57.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘁...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.75,0:11:59.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:01.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.84,0:12:05.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,只要衝上去打近身！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:06.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.06,0:12:09.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,拳頭可比揮劍要來的快！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.89,0:12:12.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:16.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,虛蜢達！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.41,0:12:21.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼... 壓軸戲現在才開始呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.39,0:12:25.55,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:39.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.55,0:12:41.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.63,0:12:43.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,披風？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:05.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,難道是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.96,0:13:08.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯！就是你想的那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.54,0:13:22.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你最親愛的颯拉拉隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:25.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我向她注入的暗塌谷能量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:30.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你做了很過分的事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:35.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你對亂暴獸的攻擊 都會回饋到隊長的身體上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:38.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.43,0:13:43.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸...不 颯拉拉獸 給我上！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:45.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:50.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你長大了啊 小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:53.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.37,0:13:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能與你像現在這樣重逢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:02.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定也是受到這寶石的指引
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:10.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.69,0:14:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該英雄亮相了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:17.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.18,0:14:26.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂... 暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.36,0:14:31.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.32,0:14:32.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:34.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:36.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.53,0:14:38.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:42.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.41,0:14:44.34,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.63,0:14:45.66,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我來！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.83,0:14:48.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:51.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:53.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮 Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.67,0:15:02.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,雙色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:04.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黃色！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:04.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.51,0:15:06.69,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,藍色！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.51,0:15:06.69,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:13.18,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,治癒的力量 飛揚起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:17.93,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你還好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.99,0:15:21.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.97,0:15:23.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.87,0:15:24.78,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.95,0:15:25.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.44,0:15:31.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.54,0:15:35.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.58,0:15:38.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不要打！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.03,0:15:40.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:42.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是隊長！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.31,0:15:45.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,它是... 颯拉拉隊長！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.77,0:15:48.03,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.67,0:15:49.52,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:52.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.28,0:15:54.55,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.71,0:16:00.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,颯拉拉隊長被暗塌谷能量 變成亂暴獸了...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.30,0:16:05.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會... 怎麼可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.52,0:16:07.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:18.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我... 真白同學...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.18,0:16:32.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不能攻擊颯拉拉隊長... 該怎麼辦...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.45,0:16:33.42,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.28,0:16:36.40,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我們這還有殺手鐧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.96,0:16:40.08,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是暗塌谷能量在作祟吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.65,0:16:45.55,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那就好！只要淨化乾淨就行了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.69,0:16:50.40,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊... 我們還有絢爛彩虹！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.89,0:16:53.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:07.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.72,0:17:08.93,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.32,0:17:10.50,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.64,0:17:11.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:13.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉... 拉拉...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.49,0:17:15.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,精... 精彩？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.49,0:17:15.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Won... Wonderful？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂... 暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.71,0:17:17.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}是啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.49,0:17:19.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 該出招了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.26,0:17:20.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.01,0:17:24.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,全色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:25.68,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,融合調色盤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:25.68,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mix Palette！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:26.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,紅色！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:26.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Red！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.82,0:17:29.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黃色！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.82,0:17:29.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,藍色！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:35.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:35.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:42.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,攪拌攪拌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,色彩填充！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Colour Charge！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.93,0:17:47.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼... 哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.95,0:17:52.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼古怪... 究竟是哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.47,0:18:03.42,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:04.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.02,0:18:09.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘁 被看出來的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:11.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.13,0:18:15.16,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這回事 哼哼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.96,0:18:21.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虛... 虛蜢蜢...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.28,0:18:32.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘁...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.89,0:18:37.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.56,0:18:41.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,饒不了你 今天的屈辱我絕對要...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.59,0:18:42.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:50.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,放任不管的話 你就完了 不過...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.76,0:18:53.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧 暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:55.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:59.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量能止住你的傷口
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:03.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,代替你流失的血液 成為你的生命力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.62,0:19:05.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.60,0:19:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.90,0:19:13.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.97,0:19:19.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,颯拉拉隊長是靠著暗塌谷能量才活著的...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.92,0:19:24.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,要是淨化掉的話 會發生什麼事呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:36.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,對！不管是你們引以自豪的絢爛彩虹 還是升流耀光
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:40.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,都會是終結隊長的奪命招數啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.01,0:19:45.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈哈... 哈哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.70,0:19:47.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂... 暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:53.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,原本的計劃 是讓你們幹掉隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.74,0:19:57.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣你們就會陷入無底的絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:20:00.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,既然被看穿了 好吧 讓你們自己選擇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.13,0:20:08.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是打倒隊長 還是被隊長打倒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.66,0:20:12.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.47,0:20:15.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.74,0:20:19.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！偏偏在高潮的地方...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.29,0:20:24.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,向人類注入暗塌谷能量 本來就不穩定
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:26.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,虛蜢達！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.91,0:20:29.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:31.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘁... 虛蜢蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.96,0:20:37.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:40.87,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我會一次又一次地來找你們玩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:45.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,直到你們的心碎成渣渣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.77,0:20:48.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.13,0:20:55.32,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.48,0:20:59.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有救回隊長的辦法的... 好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.01,0:21:02.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你告訴我有什麼方法...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.71,0:21:03.51,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.67,0:21:04.88,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 調色盤！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.12,0:21:08.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,使用融合調色盤 應該會起效果的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.67,0:21:13.65,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,先淨化暗塌谷能量 然後馬上用治療的功能
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:15.43,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,應該就能救到...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:16.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要是不行呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.89,0:21:18.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,颯拉拉隊長會怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:20.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？這... 這就...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.08,0:21:23.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯麗！只能相信這個方法 付諸行動了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.97,0:21:25.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄是永不言棄的...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.07,0:21:27.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,別說了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.79,0:21:30.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼英雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.61,0:21:31.73,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:37.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想... 再戰鬥了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.57,0:21:44.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,幻鏡筆！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.22,0:23:48.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒能成為英雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.87,0:23:51.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了 上次的亂暴獸出現在城裡了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.33,0:23:52.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,而且變得更強了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.69,0:23:53.72,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟要怎麼辦...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.92,0:23:55.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.00,0:23:58.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我們去救颯拉拉隊長！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.09,0:24:00.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.09,0:24:00.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.37,0:24:03.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,粉碎的夢想與復甦的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.49,0:01:27.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.29,0:01:32.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.63,0:01:40.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.54,0:01:45.50,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:49.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:51.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.23,0:01:55.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.11,0:02:00.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.20,0:02:02.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:06.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:10.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.61,0:02:14.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.65,0:02:14.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:15.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:15.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:21.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:26.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.66,0:02:31.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.90,0:02:36.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:39.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:47.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
